sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Cashier as Cashier / Patient
    participant System as Smart Hospital System (SHMS)

    Cashier->>System: generateConsolidatedBill(patientId)
    activate System
    System->>System: aggregateUnbilledCharges()
    System->>System: calculateTaxesAndDiscounts()
    System-->>Cashier: displayBillSummary(billId, netAmount, lineItems)
    deactivate System

    Cashier->>System: submitPayment(billId, amount, paymentMode)
    activate System
    System->>System: processPaymentTransaction()
    System->>System: updateBillStatusToPaid()
    System->>System: generateReceipt()
    System-->>Cashier: paymentReceiptIssued(receiptId, status="Paid")
    deactivate System
